{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026E0lrCe1DM81795562104.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>復任輝達行政總裁的黃仁勳向員工表示，公司不需要建立接班計劃。</p><p></p><p>財經頻道CNBC報道，黃仁勳主持復職後首場員工會議時，向員工表示抱歉，並承諾往後會做得更好。在談及公司接班計劃時，黃仁勳認為，輝達已建立了一個非一般組織，不需要正式接班計劃，因為公司內部採取獨特的營運模式，內部已有多位能力出眾的領導者，分別負責組織的不同部門。報道提到黃仁勳解釋，制定接班計劃反而會造成不必要的層級制度。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T00:23:52.687180+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":191,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T22:55:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T21:09:02.967300+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T00:17:16.544097+00:00","content_hash":"8a3dc2b3058c9d842f3675f3fb54f6f77c5dc3cec110b821b86609f53b3f4e48","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-25T00:23:52.687180+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}